{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星田曦薇昨日出席《嫁金釵》研討會，演技被指愈來愈好的她，在會上獲讚可衝擊白玉蘭、金鷹等視壇大獎時，她開心得掩嘴甜笑，獲網民大讚可愛！</p><p>除了田曦薇之外，肖戰與劉詩詩分別亮相不同研討會，並高度參與討論，盡顯專業。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:24:24.684995+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_hash":"f848df8a2b6c4ee87911510d4f180dfe25895040e89cfab2049242967fd6c072","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}